.env
# 專案產生的 Review 與 Module Context 預設只保留在本機。
agent-workspaces/reviews/*
!agent-workspaces/reviews/README.md
agent-workspaces/module-context/*
!agent-workspaces/module-context/README.md
# 驗收報告屬於本機執行產物；測試程式、案例與預期結果仍需納入版本控制。
AI-Workflow/tests/results/*
!AI-Workflow/tests/results/README.md
# Local Workflow runtime artifacts. Keep project.config.json tracked.
.ai-workflow/runtime/
AI-Workflow/runtime/
